# Scene fx-bubbles (test/README.md): t0a0b's env_bubbles #230 (brush *111,
# x -1730..-1724 y -994..-988 z -452..-132) and #231 (*112, x
# -1702..-1696 y -398..-392 z -452..-248), density 2, frequency 2: TE_FIZZ
# every 2.3 s from 2 s after spawn (HLSDK CBubbling; the bubbles' own
# numbers are render-fx.md 5 [EST]), seen under water. Off-route poses.
startmap t0a0b
waitmap t0a0b 60
god 1
stats begin
setpos -1500 -994 -330 -10 180
wait 10
shot bubbles-a
setpos -1716 -660 -359 -15 88
wait 3
shot bubbles-b
stats end
wait 0.2
pass
